      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT MIX (3) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and four placings from 10 starts. Recorded a 2.5 lengths win (17.32) in a Grade 4 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. BUGLE GIRL (2) pinged the lids from a wide box and crossed to the lead, sticking on for second (17.69) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Expecting another good run. LET'S TROT WILL (1) was prominent early off a low draw but weakened and dropped out when 5th over 388m at Gosford in Grade 5 company. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ZIPPING TANAKA (4) boasts a solid strike-rate over this track and distance.",
